/* Deploy StoredProcedure SMigration.MetadataApply_VerifyConvergence using CanonicalAlter from C:\Users\stephen.brett\source\CymBuild.Monorepo\Database\CymBuild_DB\Schema\Programmability\Procedures\SMigration.MetadataApply_VerifyConvergence.sql */
/*
    CymBuild generated canonical schema source.
    Generated by       : CYB-361 R7C4 selected DEV schema source sync
    Object             : StoredProcedure SMigration.MetadataApply_VerifyConvergence
    Source schema hash : 046F64120D48973CBD3CC56BE61AA487DC8472B996358AE6A374E1DA0B35E84A
    Definition SHA-256 : 828A127132D76CDE0E507A50B519EA0DF09F2575CB8A9A20FB93C464C23C73E9

    This deterministic file was synchronized from an explicitly selected, validated and accepted
    CymBuild_Dev source-definition snapshot. Review and commit the source-control diff before using
    it for promotion.
