    Object             : StoredProcedure SMigration.OnboardingStage_Reset
    Source schema hash : 625C3C5625204DCAA913CEC6A3D2B37F088DBBF31F94F56C2013EFA42C49EBE3
    Definition SHA-256 : DF234F8DCB899D192D5B4A212F4C6A776594DDB4619453DDB7BEF44341C32D4A

    This deterministic file was synchronized from an explicitly selected, validated and accepted
